  "term": "homelessness",
  "definition": "Homelessness is a condition in which a person is sleeping rough or living in homeless accommodation, and it can also be hidden rather than easily seen. In the material provided, it is linked with trauma, abuse, poor mental health, difficulty accessing healthcare and other support, and worse health and survival outcomes.",
